        <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">由專業師資與具國際證照顧問帶領，提供系統化課程，為企業與個人培育淨零碳排關鍵人才。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- 區塊一：iPAS -->
    <section class="section-content">
        <div class="training-category-header">
            <span class="category-tag">國家級能力鑑定</span>
            <h2 class="section-heading">iPAS 課程培訓成果</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-desc">協助學員掌握經濟部產業人才能力鑑定（iPAS）核心職能，順利取得專業證照。</p>
        
        <div class="training-cards-grid">
            <div class="training-card">
                <div class="training-icon">📜</div>
                <h3>淨零碳規劃師能力培訓</h3>
                <p class="training-type">聚焦溫室氣體盤查、減量法規與碳管理實務，輔導學員高效通過 iPAS 鑑定。</p>
                <span class="training-year">熱烈開班中</span>
            </div>
            <div class="training-card">
                <div class="training-icon">🎯</div>
                <h3>企業考照衝刺輔導班</h3>
                <p class="training-type">結合歷屆考題解析與實務模擬演練，精準掌握得分關鍵。</p>
                <span class="training-year">高通過率實績</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 區塊二：ISO -->
    <section class="section-content">
        <div class="training-category-header">
            <span class="category-tag">國際標準接軌</span>
            <h2 class="section-heading">ISO 國際課程培訓成果</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-desc">輔導企業內部人才取得國際標準主導稽核員或內部稽核員資格。</p>
        
        <div class="training-cards-grid">
            <div class="training-card">
                <div class="training-icon">🌐</div>
                <h3>ISO 14064-1 溫室氣體盤查</h3>
                <p class="training-type">主導稽核員/內部稽核員培訓，協助企業建立自主盤查能力。</p>
                <span class="training-year">專業認證班</span>
            </div>
            <div class="training-card">
                <div class="training-icon">📊</div>
                <h3>ISO 14067 產品碳足跡</h3>
                <p class="training-type">產品碳足跡標準解析與生命週期評估（LCA）實務訓練。</p>
                <span class="training-year">實作演練</span>
            </div>
            <div class="training-card">
                <div class="training-icon">🔄</div>
                <h3>ISO 14001 / ISO 50001</h3>
                <p class="training-type">環境管理與能源管理系統建置與稽核培訓課程。</p>
                <span class="training-year">企業內訓熱門</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

